      "content": "i know, i read about the oxalate thing but i feel like if i take enough of it it'll just help flush everything out more effectively. plus i feel like my immune system is low too. if i take it with a ton of water, wouldn't that neutralize the oxalate risk? just tell me if i can safely do the 3000mg a day thing to help clear the stones.",
